      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Quick update on this: As of the last several months, OpenComposite no longer seems to work with VRChat (it crashes). As a side effect, this neat waist tracker workaround is no longer viable. Being able to do this natively would be the best way of ensuring this feature is around for the foreseeable future.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-12-12T02:21:17.925Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I know that at the moment, we can use a third touch controller (Oculus VR object) as a waist tracker via the native SDK in OpenComposite, but this functionality doesn’t seem to be present in the Oculus Store version. Is this something we may see added?",
